      "issues": [
        {
          "category": "diversity",
          "evidence": "All216 initial states are(2,2), all twelve F traces share the first seven complete events, R histories/checkpoints are identical and P full outputs are identical. The remaining family graph differences are real but mostly occur after this common core.",
          "fix": "In a fresh generator/version vary actual initial state, retained binding values, interruption locations and caller contexts while maintaining matched controls. Count twelve programs, not216 independent examples or108 mechanisms.",
          "issue_id": "shared_cut_and_state",
          "nonblocking_reason": "The public pilot declares correlated views and a finite exact execution proxy; actual required relationships and full outputs are correct. No arbitrary-cut or broad-transfer coverage is approved.",
